 "remarks": "Welcome to sought-after Chesterfield! Rarely available, this desirable Waterford-style unit offers an exceptional blend of space, style and convenience. The skylit, renovated kitchen impresses with vaulted ceilings, quartz countertops and stainless steel appliances. A bright living room with fireplace and sliders opens to a private deck. The dining area and powder room complete the main level. Upstairs, the primary bedroom features two double closets and an updated bath with separate jetted tub, glass-enclosed shower and skylight. Walk-up attic provides valuable additional storage. The finished lower level (included in square footage) offers a versatile office/den, updated full bath and direct access to the garage. Enjoy resort-style living in this gated community with two pools, clubhouse and 24-hour security. Ideally located across from Ridgeway Shopping Center and just minutes to vibrant downtown, shopping, dining and transportation.",
